results/
*.csv
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv*/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# Local model-catalogue overlay (cbench gate --save) -- per-user, grown
# locally, never meant to be committed. The packaged seed lives at
# src/openllm_cbench/data/models/verified.json instead.
models.json

# Dev-tooling aid (Claude Code subagent definition) used only while
# building this repo -- kept locally, not part of the public release
# (this project deliberately avoids assuming any one AI coding tool,
# see CONTRIBUTING.md).
.claude/

# Launch-time exclusivity lock (core/runlock.py) -- created and removed
# at runtime by `cbench assess`/`cbench score`, per-machine, never meant
# to be committed. A leftover lock directory here would mean either a
# crashed run mid-lock or (as happened once, live) an orphaned verification
# script's subprocess still genuinely running -- check `core/runlock.py`'s
# own liveness rules (or just `tasklist`/`ps` for the recorded owner pid)
# before ever deleting this by hand.
.cbench/
